# Build context is the workspace root (src/); keep it lean — only what the Docker build needs.
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
**/build
**/dist
**/data
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/coverage
**/.vitest
apps/web/test
apps/web/tests
packages/*/test
**/playwright-report
**/test-results*
apps/desktop
**/.git
**/.vscode
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
